Hi,

Thanks for quick response.

I imported Bismark aligned SAM files using read.bismark(). I saved methylation called using the parameter save.folder. Then I imported methylation call files using read().

I did not use read.bismark() to import all SAMs because it is serial process and takes lots of time (when number of sample is over 100). Alternately, I saved methylation call files from each sample (parallel) and later imported them.

If I did not make it clear, I can create a test script and post it here.

